{"exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵盖鲁尔特","text":"[show]你们是之前的荒野客……啊不，契约者？有什么事吗？[r]茜塔小姐请各位问我关于装备的事情？[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵盖鲁尔特","text":"[show]嗯……我之前做契约者的时候，的确对装备的搭配非常在意。[r]这也导致大家都觉得我更喜欢利刃和护甲，没几个姑娘看得上我。[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵盖鲁尔特","text":"[show]……总之，根据战斗的方式不同，适合的武器和防具的类型也有不同。[r]合身的装备能极大地提高自身进攻的优势，也能保护薄弱的部位。[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵盖鲁尔特","text":"[show]不过光这么说也没法给各位提供合适的建议。不然……[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"bright":0,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"x":674,"noOut":false,"img":"chara005_0","trans":true,"noIn":false,"y":-293,"alpha":0}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"bright":0,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"x":674,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"img":"chara005_0","trans":true,"noIn":false,"y":-293,"alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"x":644,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"img":"chara005_0","trans":true,"noIn":false,"y":-293,"alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"right","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]不然，就通过实战来观摩观摩你们的战斗风格吧？[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"shake","para":{"y":"0","d":"0.8","layer":"chara1","x":"10"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","trans":true,"noIn":false,"y":-264.80000000000007,"alpha":0}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"no